    "name": "Todos API",
    "description": "This is an open and free to use API for developers to test their client projects.\n        All api calls require you to pass in  your API Key with the querystring\n        ?apikey=########-####-####-####-############, Please\n        register for your own API Key today at https://todoapi.net/register\n        Optional: use your own auth service. By default this API has its own users. If you already have an auth service, or you use the SimpleAPI Auth API (auth.simpleapi.dev), point your key at it with POST https://keys.simpleapi.dev/api/keys/auth-url. The user calls (/users/...) then accept that service's tokens, and register, login, logout and password reset here answer 409.\n\nImport the matching environment, set `apikey` to your key from https://keys.simpleapi.dev, then run the requests top to bottom. Register and login save the session token into the environment.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
